The '''Meridional Ice Cap''' was a [[Temperature|cold]] region of the [[planet]] [[Tython]]. The [[Martyrium of Frozen Tears]] was located within the Meridional Ice Cap. After learning the location of the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]] [[Echo Base|base]] on [[Hoth]], [[Doctor]] [[Chelli Lona Aphra|Chelli Aphra]] instead led [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]] to the Meridional Ice Cap on Tython.<ref name="Aphra 40" />

